{
 "component": "GalleryGrid",
 "version": 1,
 "summary": "A whole gallery screen from data: an optional header, then a scrolling grid of visual items (a picture or drawn tile, a title, a caption and a price or count), with optional section headings. The column count follows the width (2 on a phone, 3 on a landscape phone, 4 on a portrait tablet, up to 6 on a wide window, more when the window is short so a whole tile fits), every tile keeps its picture's aspect ratio, and a tap sets the selected index (ringed) and runs onClick.",
 "params": {
  "items": {
   "type": "list",
   "required": true,
   "static": true,
   "doc": "One object per tile: {\"title\", \"caption\", \"meta\", \"art\", \"color\", \"symbol\", \"badge\", \"section\", \"label\"}, all optional but title is usual. title is one line under the picture, caption a muted line under it (\"25 min, easy\", \"12 photos\"), meta a short bold value at the caption line's end (\"$24\", \"4.8\"). art is any node filling the picture box (a drawing, a canvas with a bitmap, CoverArt); without art a CoverArt in color (default primary) with symbol (default the symbol param) is drawn, turned by the index so tiles differ. badge is a short text on the picture's top-start corner (\"New\", \"-20%\"), a pill in onSurface that reads on any picture. section starts a new full-width heading before this tile (\"October 2026\"). label replaces the spoken text"
  },
  "title": {
   "type": "string",
   "doc": "The screen's heading (\"Library\"). Omit for no header"
  },
  "subtitle": {
   "type": "string",
   "doc": "A muted line under the title (\"248 photos\")"
  },
  "style": {
   "type": "enum",
   "values": [
    "plain",
    "card"
   ],
   "default": "plain",
   "static": true,
   "doc": "plain: a rounded picture with the text under it on the background (photos, covers). card: picture and text inside one rounded surface card (products, recipes)"
  },
  "aspect": {
   "type": "float",
   "default": 1,
   "static": true,
   "doc": "The picture's height over its width: 1 square, 0.75 landscape 4:3, 0.5625 16:9, 1.33 portrait 3:4 (book or game covers)"
  },
  "minTile": {
   "type": "float",
   "default": 150,
   "static": true,
   "doc": "Narrowest tile in dp: columns = floor(usable width / (minTile + gap)), between minColumns and maxColumns"
  },
  "minColumns": {
   "type": "float",
   "default": 2,
   "static": true,
   "doc": "Fewest columns, even on a narrow window"
  },
  "maxColumns": {
   "type": "float",
   "default": 6,
   "static": true,
   "doc": "Most columns on a wide window"
  },
  "gap": {
   "type": "float",
   "default": 12,
   "static": true,
   "doc": "Space between tiles, across and down"
  },
  "radius": {
   "type": "float",
   "default": 14,
   "static": true,
   "doc": "Corner radius of the picture (plain) or the card"
  },
  "symbol": {
   "type": "string",
   "default": "image",
   "static": true,
   "doc": "Material Symbols name drawn on the generated cover of a tile without art or its own symbol"
  },
  "selected": {
   "type": "variable",
   "initial": -1,
   "doc": "The tapped tile, from 0 (-1: none). Bind a resources variable (\"@sel\") to read it, preset it or show the item elsewhere. Do not name it step"
  },
  "highlight": {
   "type": "bool",
   "default": true,
   "static": true,
   "doc": "Ring the selected tile's picture in primary. false: a tap only sets selected and runs onClick"
  },
  "onClick": {
   "type": "action",
   "doc": "Actions run on every tile tap after selected is set, so they see the NEW index: {\"type\": \"hostNamedAction\", \"name\": \"openPhoto\", \"value\": \"@sel\", \"valueType\": \"float\", \"actionType\": 0} with \"selected\": \"@sel\" tells the app which one"
  },
  "background": {
   "type": "color",
   "default": "@colors.background",
   "doc": "The screen's background"
  },
  "width": {
   "type": "float",
   "default": "windowWidth()",
   "doc": "The width it has, when it is not the whole window; the column count follows it"
  },
  "height": {
   "type": "float",
   "default": "windowHeight()",
   "doc": "The height it has; the grid scrolls inside it"
  }
 },
 "slots": {
  "headerEnd": {
   "optional": true,
   "doc": "At the end of the header: an IconButton (search, sort), a Badge"
  },
  "footer": {
   "optional": true,
   "doc": "Written once, under the grid: a note, a Button that acts on the selected variable (Open, Add to cart)"
  }
 },
 "locals": {
  "hh": {
   "$if": "title",
   "then": {
    "$if": "subtitle",
    "then": 64,
    "else": 56
   },
   "else": 0
  },
  "pad": "16 - @gap / 2",
  "iw": "@width - 2 * @pad",
  "th": {
   "$if": "style == 'card'",
   "then": 60,
   "else": 48
  },
  "amax": "(@height - @hh) * 0.85 - @th - @gap",
  "cols": "clamp(@minColumns, @maxColumns, max(floor(@iw / (@minTile + @gap)), ceil(@iw / (@amax / @aspect + @gap))))",
  "cell": "floor(@iw / @cols)",
  "tw": "@cell - @gap",
  "ah": "floor(@tw * @aspect)",
  "gh": "@height - @hh"
 },
 "capabilities": [
  "layout.flow",
  "layout.scroll",
  "input.tap",
  "a11y.labels"
 ],
 "call": {
  "GalleryGrid": {
   "title": "Albums",
   "items": [
    {
     "title": "Lisbon",
     "caption": "48 photos"
    },
    {
     "title": "Hiking",
     "caption": "112 photos"
    }
   ]
  }
 },
 "body": {
  "column": {
   "modifiers": [
    {
     "width": "@width"
    },
    {
     "height": "@height"
    },
    {
     "background": "@background"
    }
   ],
   "children": [
    {
     "variable": {
      "name": "sy",
      "value": 0
     }
    },
    {
     "$if": "title",
     "then": {
      "row": {
       "verticalAlignment": "center",
       "modifiers": [
        "fillMaxWidth",
        {
         "height": "@hh"
        },
        {
         "padding": [
          16,
          0
         ]
        }
       ],
       "children": [
        {
         "column": {
          "modifiers": [
           {
            "weight": 1
           }
          ],
          "children": [
           {
            "text": {
             "value": "@title",
             "fontSize": "@theme.text_lg",
             "fontWeight": 700,
             "color": "@colors.onSurface",
             "maxLines": 1,
             "overflow": "ellipsis"
            }
           },
           {
            "$if": "subtitle",
            "then": {
             "text": {
              "value": "@subtitle",
              "fontSize": "@theme.text_sm",
              "color": "@colors.muted",
              "maxLines": 1,
              "overflow": "ellipsis",
              "modifiers": [
               {
                "padding": {
                 "top": 2
                }
               }
              ]
             }
            }
           }
          ]
         }
        },
        {
         "$slot": "headerEnd"
        }
       ]
      }
     }
    },
    {
     "column": {
      "modifiers": [
       "fillMaxWidth",
       {
        "height": "@gh"
       },
       {
        "verticalScroll": "@sy"
       },
       {
        "padding": [
         "@pad",
         0,
         "@pad",
         12
        ]
       }
      ],
      "children": [
       {
        "flow": {
         "modifiers": [
          "fillMaxWidth"
         ],
         "children": [
          {
           "$each": "items",
           "as": "r",
           "index": "i",
           "fields": [
            "title",
            "caption",
            "meta",
            "art",
            "color",
            "symbol",
            "badge",
            "section",
            "label"
           ],
           "do": [
            {
             "$if": "r_section",
             "then": {
              "box": {
               "modifiers": [
                {
                 "width": "@iw"
                },
                {
                 "padding": [
                  "@gap / 2",
                  10,
                  "@gap / 2",
                  8
                 ]
                }
               ],
               "children": [
                {
                 "text": {
                  "value": "@r_section",
                  "fontSize": "@theme.text_md",
                  "fontWeight": 700,
                  "color": "@colors.onSurface",
                  "maxLines": 1,
                  "overflow": "ellipsis"
                 }
                }
               ]
              }
             }
            },
            {
             "box": {
              "modifiers": [
               {
                "width": "@cell"
               },
               {
                "padding": [
                 "@gap / 2",
                 "@gap / 2"
                ]
               }
              ],
              "children": [
               {
                "column": {
                 "modifiers": [
                  "fillMaxWidth",
                  {
                   "clip": {
                    "roundedRect": "@radius"
                   }
                  },
                  {
                   "$if": "style == 'card'",
                   "then": {
                    "$if": "theme.mono",
                    "then": {
                     "background": "@colors.background"
                    },
                    "else": {
                     "background": "@colors.surface"
                    }
                   }
                  },
                  {
                   "semantics": {
                    "clickable": true,
                    "contentDescription": {
                     "$if": "r_label",
                     "then": "@r_label",
                     "else": {
                      "$if": "r_caption",
                      "then": {
                       "type": "textMerge",
                       "id1": "@r_title",
                       "id2": {
                        "type": "textMerge",
                        "id1": ", ",
                        "id2": "@r_caption"
                       }
                      },
                      "else": "@r_title"
                     }
                    }
                   }
                  },
                  {
                   "onClick": [
                    {
                     "type": "valueFloatChange",
                     "target": "@selected",
                     "value": "@i"
                    },
                    {
                     "$if": "onClick",
                     "then": "@onClick"
                    }
                   ]
                  }
                 ],
                 "children": [
                  {
                   "box": {
                    "modifiers": [
                     "fillMaxWidth",
                     {
                      "height": "@ah"
                     }
                    ],
                    "children": [
                     {
                      "$if": "r_art",
                      "then": {
                       "box": {
                        "modifiers": [
                         "fillMaxSize",
                         {
                          "$if": "style == 'card'",
                          "else": {
                           "clip": {
                            "roundedRect": "@radius"
                           }
                          }
                         }
                        ],
                        "children": [
                         "@r_art"
                        ]
                       }
                      },
                      "else": {
                       "CoverArt": {
                        "seed": "@i",
                        "symbol": {
                         "$if": "r_symbol",
                         "then": "@r_symbol",
                         "else": "@symbol"
                        },
                        "color": {
                         "$if": "r_color",
                         "then": "@r_color",
                         "else": "@colors.primary"
                        },
                        "radius": {
                         "$if": "style == 'card'",
                         "then": 0,
                         "else": "@radius"
                        },
                        "label": {
                         "$if": "r_title",
                         "then": "@r_title",
                         "else": "Picture"
                        }
                       }
                      }
                     },
                     {
                      "$if": "r_badge",
                      "then": {
                       "box": {
                        "modifiers": [
                         {
                          "padding": 8
                         }
                        ],
                        "children": [
                         {
                          "Badge": {
                           "text": "@r_badge",
                           "color": "@colors.onSurface"
                          }
                         }
                        ]
                       }
                      }
                     },
                     {
                      "$if": "highlight",
                      "then": {
                       "canvas": {
                        "modifiers": [
                         {
                          "visibility": "1 - min(1, abs(@selected - @i))"
                         },
                         "fillMaxSize"
                        ],
                        "commands": [
                         {
                          "paint": {
                           "ops": [
                            {
                             "color": "@colors.primary"
                            },
                            {
                             "style": "stroke"
                            },
                            {
                             "strokeWidth": 4
                            },
                            {
                             "alpha": 1
                            }
                           ]
                          }
                         },
                         {
                          "drawRoundRect": {
                           "left": 2,
                           "top": 2,
                           "right": "componentWidth() - 2",
                           "bottom": "componentHeight() - 2",
                           "rx": {
                            "$if": "style == 'card'",
                            "then": 0,
                            "else": "@radius - 2"
                           },
                           "ry": {
                            "$if": "style == 'card'",
                            "then": 0,
                            "else": "@radius - 2"
                           }
                          }
                         }
                        ]
                       }
                      }
                     }
                    ]
                   }
                  },
                  {
                   "column": {
                    "modifiers": [
                     "fillMaxWidth",
                     {
                      "$if": "style == 'card'",
                      "then": {
                       "padding": [
                        12,
                        10,
                        12,
                        12
                       ]
                      },
                      "else": {
                       "padding": [
                        2,
                        8,
                        2,
                        2
                       ]
                      }
                     }
                    ],
                    "children": [
                     {
                      "$if": "r_title",
                      "then": {
                       "text": {
                        "value": "@r_title",
                        "fontSize": 15,
                        "fontWeight": 600,
                        "color": "@colors.onSurface",
                        "maxLines": 1,
                        "overflow": "ellipsis"
                       }
                      }
                     },
                     {
                      "$if": "r_caption || r_meta",
                      "then": {
                       "row": {
                        "verticalAlignment": "center",
                        "modifiers": [
                         "fillMaxWidth",
                         {
                          "padding": {
                           "top": 2
                          }
                         }
                        ],
                        "children": [
                         {
                          "$if": "r_caption",
                          "then": {
                           "text": {
                            "value": "@r_caption",
                            "fontSize": 13,
                            "color": "@colors.muted",
                            "maxLines": 1,
                            "overflow": "ellipsis",
                            "modifiers": [
                             {
                              "weight": 1
                             }
                            ]
                           }
                          }
                         },
                         {
                          "$if": "r_meta",
                          "then": {
                           "text": {
                            "value": "@r_meta",
                            "fontSize": 14,
                            "fontWeight": 700,
                            "color": "@colors.onSurface",
                            "maxLines": 1,
                            "modifiers": [
                             {
                              "padding": {
                               "start": 6
                              }
                             }
                            ]
                           }
                          }
                         }
                        ]
                       }
                      }
                     }
                    ]
                   }
                  }
                 ]
                }
               }
              ]
             }
            }
           ]
          }
         ]
        }
       },
       {
        "$if": "footer",
        "then": {
         "box": {
          "modifiers": [
           "fillMaxWidth",
           {
            "padding": [
             "@gap / 2",
             8
            ]
           }
          ],
          "children": [
           {
            "$slot": "footer"
           }
          ]
         }
        }
       }
      ]
     }
    }
   ]
  }
 },
 "pitfalls": [
  "Columns follow the window, never the content: floor((width - 2 * (16 - gap / 2)) / (minTile + gap)), raised when the window is short so a whole tile (picture and text) takes at most 85% of the grid's height, kept between minColumns and maxColumns. With the defaults (minTile 150, gap 12, square): 2 at 360x640, 3 at 640x360, 4 at 800x1280, 6 at 1280x800; a portrait aspect (1.25) gets 4 at 640x360",
  "Every tile keeps aspect (picture height over width) at every column count; only the text under it is fixed (title one line, caption and meta one line). Keep meta short (\"$24\", \"4.8\"): it is never cut, the caption is ellipsized beside it",
  "art fills the picture box exactly: a canvas or box with fillMaxSize (draw from componentWidth() and componentHeight(), not from a size), or CoverArt with no size. In plain style the box clips art to radius; in card style the card clips it",
  "A section field starts a full-width heading before its tile and a new row of tiles; a row before it may stay short. There is no sticky header",
  "The grid scrolls inside height minus the header: no weights or fillMaxHeight inside art. Every tile is written into the document: fine for tens of items; for hundreds, page them from the app",
  "Tap sets selected (from 0, -1 none) and then runs onClick, which sees the new index: send it with {\"type\": \"hostNamedAction\", \"name\": \"open\", \"value\": \"@sel\", \"valueType\": \"float\", \"actionType\": 0}. The action is written in every tile, so the name is used many times: json2rc declares it once on purpose (the reference parser writes it only in the first tile's list, so its bytes differ)",
  "Each distinct symbol in a generated cover is a Material Symbols path written once, about 1.5 KB: twelve different symbols are most of a 38 KB document (CMP-46). Reuse symbols, or pass art drawn from a few primitives (CMP-45's Snapshot is about 0.5 KB a photo)",
  "Not for tiles of different kinds (a chart beside a list beside a gauge): that is a dashboard grid. Not for rows of data that become tiles when wide: that is RowList. GalleryGrid is pictures first",
  "width and height default to the window: pass them when it sits under a bar or inside a pane (a NavShell page: give height the page's height and set NavShell scroll to false)"
 ]
}